OL,3,ASydney police investigate second
OL,4,Apossible mistaken identity killing in
OL,5,Atwo days
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice in Sydney are investigating a
OL,8,Fsecond possible mistaken identity
OL,9,Fkilling at the hands of organised crime
OL,10,Fin less than 48 hours.
OL,12,FAbout 15:15 local time on Wednesday,
OL,13,Femergency services rushed to a home in
OL,14,FMerrylands West after reports a man in
OL,15,Fhis 40s had been targeted in a drive-by
OL,16,Fshooting. He died at the scene.
OL,18,FA day earlier, about 03:40 on Tuesday,
OL,19,Fa university student in his 20s with no
OL,20,Fcriminal ties, was shot during a home
OL,21,Finvasion in Glen Alpine in the city's
OL,22,Fsouthwest. He also died at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
