OL,3,ASydney police investigate second
OL,4,Apossible mistaken identity killing in
OL,5,Atwo days
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice say the Tuesday shooting appears
OL,8,Fto be an "innocent life" taken by
OL,9,Forganised crime while Wednesday's fatal
OL,10,Fattack may have targeted the "wrong
OL,11,Fperson".
